At 4 PM, my workday at the office ends.
I say goodbye to my colleagues and take the metro home.
In the hallway, I meet my neighbor, Nina.
She is standing by her door with a bag of apples.
"Hi Maya, how is it going?" Nina asks smiling.
"Hi Nina, it is going well," I answer.
"I am tired, but I am looking forward to a quiet evening."
Nina nods and gives me a red apple from the bag.
"Good evening, see you!" she says kindly.
I thank her and let myself into my warm apartment.
